    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>DecorationPreSettings</name>
      <id>76</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Before continuing the setup:
 • Set up the integration process in &lt;b>1C:Bus&lt;/> and add &lt;b>infosystems&lt;/>
 • Configure the &lt;link IntegrationServices>integration service&lt;/>
 • Enable the scheduled job &lt;link ScheduledJob>Integration service processing&lt;/>

For details, see &lt;link Help>Help&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>پیش از ادامه تنظیم:
 • فرایند یکپارچه‌سازی را در &lt;b>1C:Bus&lt;/> تنظیم کرده و &lt;b>سیستم‌های اطلاعاتی&lt;/> را اضافه کنید
 • &lt;link IntegrationServices>سرویس یکپارچه‌سازی&lt;/> را پیکربندی کنید
 • کار زمان‌بندی‌شده &lt;link ScheduledJob>پردازش سرویس یکپارچه‌سازی&lt;/> را فعال کنید

برای جزئیات، به &lt;link Help>راهنما&lt;/> مراجعه کنید.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Перед продолжением настройки:
• В &lt;b>1С:Шина&lt;/> настройте процесс интеграции и добавьте &lt;b>инфосистемы&lt;/>; 
• Настройте &lt;link IntegrationServices>сервис интеграции&lt;/>;
• Включите регламентное задание &lt;link ScheduledJob>Обработка сервисов интеграции&lt;/>; 

Подробную инструкцию см. в &lt;link Help>справке&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Konfigürasyona devam etmeden önce: 
• &lt;b>1C:Bus'ta&lt;/> entegrasyon sürecini konfigüre edin ve &lt;b>bilgi sistemleri&lt;/> ekleyin;
 • &lt;link IntegrationServices>Entegrasyon hizmetini ayarlayın&lt;/>;
 • Zamanlanmış görevi etkinleştirin &lt;link ScheduledJob>Entegrasyon hizmetlerinin işlenmesi&lt;/>; 

Ayrıntılı talimatlar için &lt;link Help>kataloğa&lt;/> bakın.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Trước khi tiếp tục tùy chỉnh:
• Trong &lt;b>1C:ESB&lt;/> hãy tùy chỉnh quá trình tích hợp và thêm &lt;b>phân hệ thông tin&lt;/>; 
• Hãy tùy chỉnh &lt;link IntegrationServices>dịch vụ tích hợp&lt;/>;
• Hãy bật sử dụng nhiệm vụ thường kỳ &lt;link ScheduledJob>Xử lý dịch vụ tích hợp&lt;/>; 

Xem cấu trúc thông tin trong &lt;link Help>trợ giúp&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Before continuing the setup:
 • Set up the integration process in &lt;b>1C:Bus&lt;/> and add &lt;b>infosystems&lt;/>
 • Configure the &lt;link IntegrationServices>integration service&lt;/>
 • Enable the scheduled job &lt;link ScheduledJob>Integration service processing&lt;/>

For details, see &lt;link Help>Help&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Before continuing the setup:
 • Set up the integration process in &lt;b>1C:Bus&lt;/> and add &lt;b>infosystems&lt;/>
 • Configure the &lt;link IntegrationServices>integration service&lt;/>
 • Enable the scheduled job &lt;link ScheduledJob>Integration service processing&lt;/>

For details, see &lt;link Help>Help&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>DecorationPreSettingsExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>78</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
